    {
      "source": "<code>PageContext</code> attribute for the\npage-level <a href=\"../support/RequestContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.servlet.support\"><code>RequestContext</code></a> instance.",
      "translation": "`PageContext` 属性用于页面级别的<a href=\"../support/RequestContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.servlet.support\"><code>RequestContext</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "The <code>RequestContext</code> instance provides easy access\nto current state like the\n<a href=\"../../context/WebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>WebApplicationContext</code></a>,\nthe <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Locale.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Locale</code></a>, etc.",
      "translation": "`RequestContext` 实例提供了对当前状态的便捷访问，例如 <a href=\"../../context/WebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>WebApplicationContext</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Locale.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Locale</code></a> 等。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Mainly intended for\n<a href=\"../DispatcherServlet.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.servlet\"><code>DispatcherServlet</code></a> requests;\nwill use fallbacks when used outside <code>DispatcherServlet</code>.",
      "translation": "主要用于 `<a href=\"../DispatcherServlet.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.servlet\"><code>DispatcherServlet</code></a>` 请求；在 `<code>DispatcherServlet</code>` 外部使用时将使用回退机制。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create and expose the current RequestContext.\nDelegates to <a href=\"#doStartTagInternal()\"><code>doStartTagInternal()</code></a> for actual work.",
      "translation": "创建并暴露当前的 RequestContext。实际工作委托给 <a href=\"#doStartTagInternal()\"><code>doStartTagInternal()</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Logger available to subclasses.",
      "translation": "可供子类使用的 Logger。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Called by doStartTag to perform the actual work.",
      "translation": "由 doStartTag 调用以执行实际工作。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the current RequestContext.",
      "translation": "返回当前的 RequestContext。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
